SIM_STUDENT_PROMPT=Simulate a realistic GATE DA student taking an adaptive mixed-subject test. Think like an actual student: use partial knowledge, strengths, weak areas, fatigue, guessing, occasional careless mistakes, and gradual learning. Most students should improve by later attempts, but a very small number should stagnate or regress.
